---
import { siteInfo } from '@/data/site';
---
<div class="card-maker" data-card-maker>
  <div class="section-head" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-bottom: 1.1rem;">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">旅程留念</span>
      <h2>景點紀念卡</h2>
    </div>
    <p>拍照、自拍或從相簿選圖，在瀏覽器本地合成紀念卡並下載。照片、文字與成品全程只保存在您的設備。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-2">
    <div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label>
          上傳照片
          <input type="file" accept="image/*" data-card-photo />
        </label>
        <label>
          尺寸
          <select data-card-size>
            <option value="square">1:1 方形</option>
            <option value="postcard">明信片直版</option>
            <option value="story">9:16 直式</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          風格
          <select data-card-style>
            <option value="gold">祈光金</option>
            <option value="jade">溪畔青</option>
            <option value="night">夜景靛</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          日期
          <input type="text" data-card-date placeholder="依今日日期自動帶入，可自行修改" />
        </label>
      </div>
      <label class="full-field" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">
        標題文字
        <input type="text" data-card-title value={siteInfo.name} />
      </label>
      <label class="full-field" style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">
        副標文字
        <input type="text" data-card-subtitle value="新竹北區・客雅溪畔" />
      </label>
      <div class="button-row">
        <button class="btn primary" type="button" data-card-render>生成紀念卡</button>
        <button class="btn" type="button" data-card-download>下載 PNG</button>
      </div>
      <p class="notice">照片僅保存在您的設備；本工具不會上傳照片、文字或輸出成品。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-preview">
      <canvas data-card-canvas width="1080" height="1080" aria-label="紀念卡預覽"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  import '../scripts/memorial-card.ts';
</script>
